1 translation units
start translation unit 1
translation-unit
  scope namespace <global>
    variable x int
    variable p pointer to int
    variable r lvalue-reference to pointer to int
    variable c lvalue-reference to const pointer to const int
    variable forward lvalue-reference to int
    variable array array of 3 const int
    variable whole lvalue-reference to array of 3 const int
    variable decayed pointer to const int
    variable scalar int
    variable pointer pointer to int
    function identity function of (int) returning int
    variable function_pointer pointer to function of (int) returning int
